  "id": "black-pulse",
  "title": "Black Pulse",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "*Black Pulse* is a thrilling sci-fi audio drama that plunges listeners into the adventures of a diverse crew navigating the treacherous edges of the galaxy. Set in a universe where rebellion, smuggling, and high-stakes missions are the norm, the crew faces everything from intense space battles to mysterious alien worlds. What makes *Black Pulse* stand out is its blend of action-packed sequences, humorous character interactions amongst the crew of 8 iconic main characters with each having a unique personality. Listeners can expect a mix of suspense, camaraderie, and the occasional laugh as the crew tackles the challenges of their missions while uncovering dark secrets that could change the fate of the galaxy. Get to know the characters in the Cast List ( https://docs.google.com/document/d/1AToOiOkVrADQfSteKIH3sZnOusu8Y4kxrSQO_KaLvDg/edit?usp=sharing ) This show uses RVC for voice modulations.",
